flowchart LR
    A["<b>AOI Input</b><br/>your own boundary polygon<br/>(gpkg / shp) <b>or</b> an 8-digit HUC8 ID<br/>&rarr; boundary resolved automatically<br/>buffered before every download"]
    subgraph SRC["Independent downloads: every dataset swappable"]
        direction LR
        B["<b>DEM</b><br/>USGS 3DEP 1 / 3 / 10 / 30 / 60 m<br/><b>or</b> your own DEM raster"]
        C["<b>Hydrography</b><br/>NWM medium res &middot; NHDPlus High Res<br/><b>or</b> your own flowlines + catchments"]
        D["<b>Hazard Layers</b><br/>FEMA NFHL flood zones<br/>USACE NLD 3D levees"]
        E["<b>Structures + Gages</b><br/>OSM roads &middot; OSM bridges<br/>USGS gages"]
